  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，你知道你有多少个祖先吗，你知道一句“列祖列宗在上”，就能码出来多少人吗，快来看看你的祖宗十八代都有谁。#祖宗 #中元节 #祭祖 #祖先",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 212.137914,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱军，你知道你有多少个祖先吗？你知道一句列祖列宗在上就能码出来多少人吗？除了龟孙儿，这就是你的祖宗十八代。你看，当你站立时，父亲站在你的左后肩，母亲站在你的右后肩，而你的父母后面又在站着他们的父亲母亲，以此类推。往上仅仅数十八代，据说你身后就站着五十二万位祖先，相当于一个小县城的人口啊，就这五十二万人里面，但凡有一个人差一个环节，在古代饿死了，或者没了，咱就不存在了。所以诸君你永远不要妄自菲薄，但凡能够留到今天。你的祖上一定是达官显贵名门望族，没点实力搁古代那个环境根本活不下来，一句列祖列宗在上，你这时候是一个人在面对问题吗？我们的祖先都站在我们的身后，你有啥坎过不去？你看这就是风华正茂的。你上一代是你的父亲，你父亲的父亲叫祖父，祖父的父亲叫曾祖，曾祖的父亲叫高祖，高祖的父亲叫天祖。天祖的父亲叫列祖，列祖的父亲叫太祖，太祖的父亲叫元祖，元祖的父亲叫鼻祖。所以我们把鼻祖做门内地位最高的人，而这就是上九代，你的下一代就是儿子。儿子的儿子叫孙子，孙子的儿子叫曾孙，曾孙的儿子叫玄孙，玄孙的儿子叫来孙，来孙的儿子叫昆孙，昆孙的儿子叫仁孙仁，孙的儿子叫云孙，云孙的儿子叫耳孙，这些就是下九代，上九辈叫祖，下九辈叫宗，合起来就是祖宗十八代。而民间说法，龟孙就是耳孙之后，也就是下时代，只是把对方贬的辈分很低，是不文明的语言啊，你知道吗？佛你可以不拜神，你可以不敬，但是祖先不能不祭死，为什么呢？因为佛有寺庙，神有道观，如果祖先不祭祀的话，就会变成孤魂野鬼。所以每一年中元节，七月半一定要祭祖，没有一个人真正是白手起家的。你以为自己是从零开始，其实你的零都是祖祖辈辈几代人的终点。朱军，您知道自己家的糖号是什么吗？比如我们肇庆啊，就有天水堂、半步堂、南阳堂、颍川堂、卓郡堂等等堂，就是房子的意思，家族昌盛就叫四世同堂，长得好看，叫相貌堂堂，为人正直叫堂堂正正。唐昊是中国一个家族的标志，全世界每一个名门望族都有自己姓氏的独特的logo,在欧洲叫盾牌，在新西兰是涂徽，在中国，这就是唐昊。比如我们家祖上半部论语治天下，所以叫半步糖。我们每一年祭祖总是在说列祖列宗保佑我们。但是朱军一百年以后你也是列祖列宗啊，我们准备给后人留下什么呢？一个家庭，最好的风水，就是祖祖辈辈怎么做人。爷爷做人厚道，父亲做事诚信，母亲待人善良，孩子从小耳濡目染，所谓祖宗，基德就是上一代，留下好名声，真的会变成下一代。走路时的底气。祖坟在哪儿，未必会决定你的命运。但是，祖辈怎么做人，真的可能会影响几代人的命运。所谓家族兴旺，并不是哪一代人突然飞黄腾达，而是一代人托举一代人，一代人照亮一代人。真正的家风是父母用思维垫高后代的起点。弯下腰，让孩子站在自己的肩膀上，看整个世界。百年之后，我们给后代留下一个什么样的世界，很大程度上取决于我们给世界留下一个什么样的后代。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1010,
      "end_ms": 2730,
      "text": "你知道你有多少个祖先吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2990,
      "end_ms": 6550,
      "text": "你知道一句列祖列宗在上就能码出来多少人吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6830,
      "end_ms": 7910,
      "text": "除了龟孙儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7910,
      "end_ms": 10070,
      "text": "这就是你的祖宗十八代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10070,
      "end_ms": 10670,
      "text": "你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10670,
      "end_ms": 11850,
      "text": "当你站立时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11850,
      "end_ms": 13590,
      "text": "父亲站在你的左后肩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00009",
      "start_ms": 13590,
      "end_ms": 15330,
      "text": "母亲站在你的右后肩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15330,
      "end_ms": 18330,
      "text": "而你的父母后面又在站着他们的父亲母亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00011",
      "start_ms": 18570,
      "end_ms": 19450,
      "text": "以此类推。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19510,
      "end_ms": 21250,
      "text": "往上仅仅数十八代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00013",
      "start_ms": 21310,
      "end_ms": 24470,
      "text": "据说你身后就站着五十二万位祖先，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00014",
      "start_ms": 24790,
      "end_ms": 26630,
      "text": "相当于一个小县城的人口啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00015",
      "start_ms": 26830,
      "end_ms": 28310,
      "text": "就这五十二万人里面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00016",
      "start_ms": 28310,
      "end_ms": 30360,
      "text": "但凡有一个人差一个环节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00017",
      "start_ms": 30360,
      "end_ms": 31120,
      "text": "在古代饿死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00018",
      "start_ms": 31120,
      "end_ms": 31900,
      "text": "或者没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00019",
      "start_ms": 31900,
      "end_ms": 33280,
      "text": "咱就不存在了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00020",
      "start_ms": 33280,
      "end_ms": 36100,
      "text": "所以诸君你永远不要妄自菲薄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00021",
      "start_ms": 36100,
      "end_ms": 37540,
      "text": "但凡能够留到今天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00022",
      "start_ms": 37540,
      "end_ms": 40480,
      "text": "你的祖上一定是达官显贵名门望族，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00023",
      "start_ms": 40480,
      "end_ms": 43200,
      "text": "没点实力搁古代那个环境根本活不下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00024",
      "start_ms": 43440,
      "end_ms": 45360,
      "text": "一句列祖列宗在上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00025",
      "start_ms": 45580,
      "end_ms": 47700,
      "text": "你这时候是一个人在面对问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00026",
      "start_ms": 47720,
      "end_ms": 49740,
      "text": "我们的祖先都站在我们的身后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00027",
      "start_ms": 49820,
      "end_ms": 51040,
      "text": "你有啥坎过不去？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00028",
      "start_ms": 51440,
      "end_ms": 53440,
      "text": "你看这就是风华正茂的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00029",
      "start_ms": 53440,
      "end_ms": 55240,
      "text": "你上一代是你的父亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00030",
      "start_ms": 55480,
      "end_ms": 56880,
      "text": "你父亲的父亲叫祖父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00031",
      "start_ms": 56880,
      "end_ms": 58800,
      "text": "祖父的父亲叫曾祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00032",
      "start_ms": 58800,
      "end_ms": 60650,
      "text": "曾祖的父亲叫高祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60970,
      "end_ms": 62565,
      "text": "高祖的父亲叫天祖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00034",
      "start_ms": 62960,
      "end_ms": 64475,
      "text": "天祖的父亲叫列祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00035",
      "start_ms": 64780,
      "end_ms": 66360,
      "text": "列祖的父亲叫太祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00036",
      "start_ms": 66560,
      "end_ms": 68175,
      "text": "太祖的父亲叫元祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00037",
      "start_ms": 68460,
      "end_ms": 70185,
      "text": "元祖的父亲叫鼻祖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00038",
      "start_ms": 70520,
      "end_ms": 73075,
      "text": "所以我们把鼻祖做门内地位最高的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00039",
      "start_ms": 73370,
      "end_ms": 75185,
      "text": "而这就是上九代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00040",
      "start_ms": 75500,
      "end_ms": 77085,
      "text": "你的下一代就是儿子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00041",
      "start_ms": 77390,
      "end_ms": 78690,
      "text": "儿子的儿子叫孙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00042",
      "start_ms": 78830,
      "end_ms": 80175,
      "text": "孙子的儿子叫曾孙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00043",
      "start_ms": 80520,
      "end_ms": 81955,
      "text": "曾孙的儿子叫玄孙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00044",
      "start_ms": 82300,
      "end_ms": 83700,
      "text": "玄孙的儿子叫来孙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00045",
      "start_ms": 83960,
      "end_ms": 85455,
      "text": "来孙的儿子叫昆孙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00046",
      "start_ms": 85730,
      "end_ms": 87670,
      "text": "昆孙的儿子叫仁孙仁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00047",
      "start_ms": 87670,
      "end_ms": 88875,
      "text": "孙的儿子叫云孙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00048",
      "start_ms": 89200,
      "end_ms": 90720,
      "text": "云孙的儿子叫耳孙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00049",
      "start_ms": 91100,
      "end_ms": 92475,
      "text": "这些就是下九代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00050",
      "start_ms": 92880,
      "end_ms": 94020,
      "text": "上九辈叫祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00051",
      "start_ms": 94320,
      "end_ms": 95440,
      "text": "下九辈叫宗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00052",
      "start_ms": 95660,
      "end_ms": 97855,
      "text": "合起来就是祖宗十八代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00053",
      "start_ms": 98190,
      "end_ms": 99070,
      "text": "而民间说法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00054",
      "start_ms": 99250,
      "end_ms": 100950,
      "text": "龟孙就是耳孙之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00055",
      "start_ms": 101030,
      "end_ms": 102275,
      "text": "也就是下时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00056",
      "start_ms": 102590,
      "end_ms": 104390,
      "text": "只是把对方贬的辈分很低，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00057",
      "start_ms": 104510,
      "end_ms": 105595,
      "text": "是不文明的语言啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00058",
      "start_ms": 105930,
      "end_ms": 106605,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00059",
      "start_ms": 106890,
      "end_ms": 108170,
      "text": "佛你可以不拜神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00060",
      "start_ms": 108170,
      "end_ms": 108950,
      "text": "你可以不敬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00061",
      "start_ms": 109130,
      "end_ms": 110590,
      "text": "但是祖先不能不祭死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00062",
      "start_ms": 110750,
      "end_ms": 111375,
      "text": "为什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00063",
      "start_ms": 111580,
      "end_ms": 112660,
      "text": "因为佛有寺庙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00064",
      "start_ms": 112660,
      "end_ms": 113435,
      "text": "神有道观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00065",
      "start_ms": 113690,
      "end_ms": 115150,
      "text": "如果祖先不祭祀的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00066",
      "start_ms": 115150,
      "end_ms": 116590,
      "text": "就会变成孤魂野鬼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00067",
      "start_ms": 116770,
      "end_ms": 118010,
      "text": "所以每一年中元节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00068",
      "start_ms": 118030,
      "end_ms": 119785,
      "text": "七月半一定要祭祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00069",
      "start_ms": 120220,
      "end_ms": 122220,
      "text": "没有一个人真正是白手起家的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00070",
      "start_ms": 122220,
      "end_ms": 124015,
      "text": "你以为自己是从零开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00071",
      "start_ms": 124280,
      "end_ms": 127725,
      "text": "其实你的零都是祖祖辈辈几代人的终点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00072",
      "start_ms": 128140,
      "end_ms": 128520,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00073",
      "start_ms": 128720,
      "end_ms": 130840,
      "text": "您知道自己家的糖号是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00074",
      "start_ms": 130980,
      "end_ms": 132260,
      "text": "比如我们肇庆啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00075",
      "start_ms": 132260,
      "end_ms": 136300,
      "text": "就有天水堂、半步堂、南阳堂、颍川堂、卓郡堂等等堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00076",
      "start_ms": 136500,
      "end_ms": 137600,
      "text": "就是房子的意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00077",
      "start_ms": 137740,
      "end_ms": 139760,
      "text": "家族昌盛就叫四世同堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00078",
      "start_ms": 139960,
      "end_ms": 140640,
      "text": "长得好看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00079",
      "start_ms": 140680,
      "end_ms": 141780,
      "text": "叫相貌堂堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00080",
      "start_ms": 141960,
      "end_ms": 143945,
      "text": "为人正直叫堂堂正正。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00081",
      "start_ms": 144340,
      "end_ms": 146485,
      "text": "唐昊是中国一个家族的标志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00082",
      "start_ms": 147000,
      "end_ms": 150885,
      "text": "全世界每一个名门望族都有自己姓氏的独特的logo,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00083",
      "start_ms": 151150,
      "end_ms": 152390,
      "text": "在欧洲叫盾牌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00084",
      "start_ms": 152570,
      "end_ms": 153790,
      "text": "在新西兰是涂徽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00085",
      "start_ms": 153930,
      "end_ms": 154510,
      "text": "在中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00086",
      "start_ms": 154550,
      "end_ms": 155745,
      "text": "这就是唐昊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00087",
      "start_ms": 156140,
      "end_ms": 158575,
      "text": "比如我们家祖上半部论语治天下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00088",
      "start_ms": 158820,
      "end_ms": 160085,
      "text": "所以叫半步糖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00089",
      "start_ms": 160500,
      "end_ms": 163835,
      "text": "我们每一年祭祖总是在说列祖列宗保佑我们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00090",
      "start_ms": 164100,
      "end_ms": 167225,
      "text": "但是朱军一百年以后你也是列祖列宗啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00091",
      "start_ms": 167590,
      "end_ms": 169365,
      "text": "我们准备给后人留下什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00092",
      "start_ms": 169830,
      "end_ms": 170410,
      "text": "一个家庭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00093",
      "start_ms": 170410,
      "end_ms": 171150,
      "text": "最好的风水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00094",
      "start_ms": 171150,
      "end_ms": 172875,
      "text": "就是祖祖辈辈怎么做人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00095",
      "start_ms": 173200,
      "end_ms": 174340,
      "text": "爷爷做人厚道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00096",
      "start_ms": 174380,
      "end_ms": 175580,
      "text": "父亲做事诚信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00097",
      "start_ms": 175660,
      "end_ms": 176815,
      "text": "母亲待人善良，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00098",
      "start_ms": 177090,
      "end_ms": 178715,
      "text": "孩子从小耳濡目染，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00099",
      "start_ms": 179170,
      "end_ms": 179830,
      "text": "所谓祖宗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00100",
      "start_ms": 179830,
      "end_ms": 180930,
      "text": "基德就是上一代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00101",
      "start_ms": 180930,
      "end_ms": 181810,
      "text": "留下好名声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00102",
      "start_ms": 181990,
      "end_ms": 183170,
      "text": "真的会变成下一代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00103",
      "start_ms": 183170,
      "end_ms": 184285,
      "text": "走路时的底气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00104",
      "start_ms": 184720,
      "end_ms": 185660,
      "text": "祖坟在哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00105",
      "start_ms": 185660,
      "end_ms": 186965,
      "text": "未必会决定你的命运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00106",
      "start_ms": 187170,
      "end_ms": 187410,
      "text": "但是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00107",
      "start_ms": 187410,
      "end_ms": 188390,
      "text": "祖辈怎么做人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00108",
      "start_ms": 188390,
      "end_ms": 190325,
      "text": "真的可能会影响几代人的命运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00109",
      "start_ms": 190690,
      "end_ms": 191670,
      "text": "所谓家族兴旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00110",
      "start_ms": 191670,
      "end_ms": 193765,
      "text": "并不是哪一代人突然飞黄腾达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00111",
      "start_ms": 194000,
      "end_ms": 195560,
      "text": "而是一代人托举一代人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00112",
      "start_ms": 195700,
      "end_ms": 197095,
      "text": "一代人照亮一代人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00113",
      "start_ms": 197440,
      "end_ms": 200995,
      "text": "真正的家风是父母用思维垫高后代的起点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00114",
      "start_ms": 201310,
      "end_ms": 201875,
      "text": "弯下腰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00115",
      "start_ms": 202160,
      "end_ms": 203720,
      "text": "让孩子站在自己的肩膀上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00116",
      "start_ms": 203720,
      "end_ms": 204685,
      "text": "看整个世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00117",
      "start_ms": 205070,
      "end_ms": 205670,
      "text": "百年之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00118",
      "start_ms": 205670,
      "end_ms": 207555,
      "text": "我们给后代留下一个什么样的世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f2d6942885baf7fa_s00119",
      "start_ms": 207920,
      "end_ms": 211885,
      "text": "很大程度上取决于我们给世界留下一个什么样的后代。"
    }
  ],
